"Journal in Bolivares (VEF) used to register the separate IGTF payment when "
"the 'Include IGTF in Payment' checkbox is UNCHECKED in the payment register "
"wizard (the source payment only covers the invoice, and the IGTF Debit Note "
"is collected with a second, independent payment). If not configured, the "
"first bank/cash journal in VEF not marked as IGTF is searched automatically."
